      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a pretty basic overview. but honestly, looking at how it's working these days, doesn't it feel like it basically undermines the whole point of \"one person, one vote\"? it seems like a pretty outdated way to run a modern democracy if the popular vote doesn't actually matter. what do you think?",
